.devcontainer/

# Per-user dotenv files and secret bundles under .envrcs/ (.envrcs/README.md).
# The bundles too: each is encrypted to one developer's key, so committing
# it gives a clone nothing. Last, so no later rule re-ignores the templates.
.envrcs/.env.*
!.envrcs/.env.*.template
